{"id":"msg_m_ex_noah_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_noah","label":"Noah · Nikke"},"label":"2. Imposter.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_noah_01","next":"msg_m_ex_noah_03","speakers":{"noah":"Noah"},"icons":{"noah":"si_c232_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_1","text":"Imposter.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_2","text":"Helllooooooo?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_3","text":"What's the matter?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_4","text":"Something really wild happened to me today.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_5","text":"Wanna hear about it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_6","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_6","text":"Tell me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_7","text":"I'd been patrolling the base for 5 hours,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_8","text":"just like you'd instructed.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_9","text":"Then there it was!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_10","text":"Right in front of me!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_11","text":"About 10 Nikkes and a Commander who looked completely out of it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_12","text":"They were wandering around our turf.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_13","text":"The only thing was, I didn't have any backup.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_14","text":"I mean, it was 10 against 1, ya know?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_15","text":"So it got me thinking as to","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_16","text":"what I should do.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_17","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_17","text":"Was there any real danger?","jump":"m_ex_noah_02_19"},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_18","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_18","text":"Was communication not an option?","jump":"m_ex_noah_02_21"},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_19","text":"Sure,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_20","text":"For them, but for not me.","jump":"m_ex_noah_02_23"},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_21","text":"Yep.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_22","text":"I could have wiped the floor with them,","jump":"m_ex_noah_02_23"},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_23","text":"but they kept running their mouths, saying they'd bring me back to the Ark by force.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_24","text":"I gave one of 'em a love tap with my shield,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_25","text":"then asked, \"Who's next?\"","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_26","text":"The Commander looked like he nearly soiled his undies!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_27","text":"I've never seen someone turn tail and run that fast, other than Isabel.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_28","text":"On seeing this, those Nikkes also became afraid of me","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_29","text":"and sneaked away.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_30","text":"Anyway, after I finished my patrol route,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_31","text":"I started getting a little worried.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_32","text":"I know I'm the best of the best,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_33","text":"but can live on the surface","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_34","text":"really be so easy?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_35","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_35","text":"You've trained hard to get to this point.","jump":"m_ex_noah_02_37"},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_36","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_36","text":"Life, not live.","jump":"m_ex_noah_02_43"},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_37","text":"Oh, hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_38","text":"You're right about it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_39","text":"You know how to handle yourself.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_40","text":"Hehehe","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_41","text":"Why are you being so genuine all of a sudden?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_42","text":"Hehehe","jump":"m_ex_noah_02_50"},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_43","text":"What?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_44","text":"No way.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_45","text":"It's live. Even I know that, and I'm a Nikke.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_46","text":"Why don't you look it up and get back to me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_47","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_47","text":"... There is no reply for a while.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_48","text":"Fine.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_49","text":"You win this round.","jump":"m_ex_noah_02_50"},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_50","text":"Anyway,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_51","text":"that's not the main point.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_52","text":"I wanted to tell you something.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_53","text":"Tell them to steer clear of this area from now on.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_54","text":"I scared them off this time, no harm done.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_55","text":"They may not be so lucky next time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_56","text":"Understand?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_57","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_57","text":"I don't have that kind of authority.","jump":"m_ex_noah_02_59"},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_58","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_58","text":"I understand.","jump":"m_ex_noah_02_61"},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_59","text":"That's your problem, not mine.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_60","text":"I've already given them a warning.","jump":"m_ex_noah_02_63"},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_61","text":"Good.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_62","text":"That's more like it.","jump":"m_ex_noah_02_63"},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_63","text":"Well, it's only right that a big strong Nikke like myself","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_64","text":"head back into the thick of it up on the surface, unlike you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_65","text":"I'll be off.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_66","text":"Don't let me catch you slacking off.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noah_02_67","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noah_02_67","text":"Noah resumes her patrol.","jump":null}],"chat":true}